<title>USA: Merrill wins $30 mln Fresno USD, Calif., GO bonds.</title>
<headline>Merrill wins $30 mln Fresno USD, Calif., GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it won $30 million of Fresno Unified School District, Calif., GO bonds, with a 5.4452 percent true interest cost (TIC).</p>
</text>
